{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20038","headline":"赠转运陆中丞 · 孟郊","name":"赠转运陆中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掌运职既大，摧邪名更雄。\n鹏飞簸曲云，鹗怒生直风。\n投彼霜雪令，翦除荆棘丛。\n楚仓倾向西，吴米发自东。\n帆影咽河口，车声聋关中。\n尧知才策高，人喜道路通。\n皆经内史力，继得酇侯功。\n莱子真爲少，相如未免穷。\n衣花野菡萏，书叶山梧桐。\n不是宗匠心，谁怜久栖蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}